      examples: [{ q: "Deduce the overall equation from Zn → Zn²⁺ + 2e⁻ and Ag⁺ + e⁻ → Ag.", a: "Multiply silver half-equation by 2 to balance electrons: Zn + 2Ag⁺ → Zn²⁺ + 2Ag." }],
